<title>USA: Firearms Training to buy SBS unit.</title>
<headline>Firearms Training to buy SBS unit.</headline>
<dateline>SUWANEE, Ga. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firearms Training Systems Inc said Wednesday its FATS Inc operating unit has signed a letter of intent to buy ICAT Judgmental Use of Force from SBS Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the sale were not disclosed.</p>
<p>FATS provides interactive firearms training systems to military and law enforcement agencies, it said.</p>
<p>SBS said the ICAT unit was &quot;not material to the performance of SBS.&quot;</p>
</text>
